  change qD H sign.opposite D d Δ y * y ≤ qD H sign.opposite D d Δ x * x
  rw [← equation14_15 H sign.opposite D d Δ x (hgt1 x hx),
      ← equation14_15 H sign.opposite D d Δ y (hgt1 y hy)]
